"g384|Bracket Battle|Party / Local|js|tap|neon|Everything is a tournament bracket. Players vote on absurd matchups until one winner remains.|The app generates matchups; the group votes by show of hands or tapping.|The bracket format creates drama out of nothing.|Endless matchups with new categories.|A universal format that can be about anything and requires no content.|party,voting,tournament,social",
