"g389|Speed Friending|Party / Local|js|tap|pastel|Timed conversations with prompts. The app is the timer and the prompt, nothing more.|Two people talk for ninety seconds on a generated prompt, then rotate.|A minimal social utility that creates real connection.|Endless prompts with new themes.|A game that is mostly a well-designed prompt generator is a strong, honest design.|party,social,icebreaker,minimal",
"g390|Memory of Us|Party / Local|js|tap|paper|The app asks questions about the group's shared history, and only the group knows the answers.|Questions are generated from past sessions: who said what, who won, who cheated.|The game's content is your group's own history, which makes it uniquely valuable over time.|Endless: grows with every session your group plays.|A game that builds its own content from your group's history is a remarkable retention idea.|party,memory,social,persistent",
