"g397|Room Escape Together|Party / Local|js|drag|paper|A physical room escape where the phone is the puzzle and the room is the map.|The app gives clues that reference the physical room you are in.|Mixing digital puzzles with physical space is memorable and highly shareable.|Endless clue sets for new rooms.|Location-aware puzzle design turns any room into a game.|party,puzzle,location,local-multiplayer",
