"g399|Championship Series|Party / Local|js|tap|neon|A season of minigames with persistent standings across multiple gatherings.|Every session adds points to a running table that survives between meetups.|Persistence across real-world gatherings is a strong retention mechanic for groups.|Endless seasons with new minigames.|Persistent standings turn a party game into a long-running group ritual.|party,competition,persistent,local-multiplayer",
